## 18. Library Organization

### 18.1 Coordinates — 🔵 LOW
- Central Repository groupId conventions: reverse-DNS (`com.example/foo`) or org/project (`nrepl/nrepl`).

### 18.2 Minimize dependencies — 🟡 MEDIUM
- A three-line utility copied in-project is better than pulling a library with hundreds of unused vars.

### 18.3 Tool-agnostic core — 🔵 LOW
- Ship core functionality separate from tooling integration.

